9023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Tv6bf","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-26T14:17:25Z","updated_at":"2023-01-26T14:17:25Z","body":"@richardfontana Thanks -- yes, this looks like it is a combination of a few things:\r\n* the preamble and clauses from [BSD-3-Clause-Attribution](https://spdx.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause-Attribution.html)\r\n* an added \"For permission or any other legal details, please contact...\" bit appended to the 3rd clause\r\n* the disclaimer from [HPND](https://spdx.org/licenses/HPND.html)\r\n\r\nI'm +1 to add -- simple permissive and historical license, used in Fedora / other distros.\r\n\r\nNaming is hard. How would you feel about this?\r\n* ID: BSD-Attribution-HPND-disclaimer\r\n* Name: BSD with Attribution and HPND disclaimer\r\n\r\nWe could instead reference CMU, but there's already a [\"CMU license\"](https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT-CMU.html) on the list (which doesn't in fact reference CMU) so I'm not terribly inclined to go that direction.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/lic